--- What is original to this project ---

The gameplay engine and renderer (game/Engine.js, game/Renderer.js), all
sprite artwork and the pixel font (game/Sprites.js), and the sound-generator
definitions in audio/make_sounds.py are original works created for this
project. No sprite, sound, or other asset was sampled, copied, or traced from
any commercial game. "Space Invaders" is a trademark of Taito Corporation;
this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Taito and does not use
Taito's name, logos, or artwork.

--- Portions derived from Quattroids (MIT) ---

